<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23829" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκα-ετής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκα-έτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ten years old,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>lasting ten years,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.25
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i> codd., <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.74b
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκέτης.</span>)—
			The statements of Gramm. as to the accentuation of this and similar
			words are confused, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				765.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Choerob.
				<u>in Theod.</u>
				1.167
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.385
			</span></i>: they were prob. parox. in Attic, oxyt. in the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινή.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
